      "title": "Preserve evidence and authority",
      "items": [
        "Original approval expires 2026-10-10T04:49:59Z; explicit recovery amendment 6060200508.",
        "Prior run produced no measurement; current absence does not resolve historical uncertainty.",
        "Preserve predecessor, token, nonce, spent usage and one worker grant; reserve another watchdog.",
        "Review source and test the complete CLI arguments offline before this one-use recovery.",
        "Unknown or multiple hosts block dispatch; a token mismatch never permits a replacement token.",
        "One owned host means cleanup only; unknown or multiple hosts require proof before cleanup.",
        "Failure reports remain non-compliant. An issued worker allocation cannot be restarted.",
        "Physical NIC/billing caps are not guaranteed; uncertainty stops the next case before seeding.",
        "S09 stays open and S10/S13 blocked until required live evidence and O-2/O-5 decisions."
